OL,3,AHusband who drugged and raped wife for
OL,4,A20 years no longer part of trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drugged and raped his wife
OL,7,Ffor more than 20 years without her
OL,8,Fknowledge will no longer be involved in
OL,9,Fa trial involving other defendants, a
OL,10,Fjury has heard.
OL,12,FThe husband, aged in his 60s and from
OL,13,Fthe Stockport area of Greater
OL,14,FManchester, has admitted a total of 60
OL,15,Foffences against the woman including
OL,16,Frape, assault by penetration,
OL,17,Fadministering a substance with intent
OL,18,Fand sharing indecent images without her
OL,19,Fconsent.
