OL,3,AHusband who drugged and raped wife for
OL,4,A20 years no longer part of trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve other men are still due to go on
OL,7,Ftrial at Manchester Minshull Street
OL,8,FCrown Court accused of serious sexual
OL,9,Foffences - including rape - against the
OL,10,Fsame woman.
OL,12,FThe nine women and three men of the
OL,13,Fjury, plus two female reserve jurors,
OL,14,Fhave been asked to return to court on 5
OL,15,FOctober.
